    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c24016d0760943849829aba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然未来的经典赛线有力候补都集结了，我也没理由拒绝。\n只在旁边观战这场顶级对决的话——未免太不解风情了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "08467de260f6c86f226b70948173dbf135568f1c198fa4c8c8580ae616f95284",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
