    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b555e9d6a7dd94744d19daef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她就是统治地位。与被称为“女帝”的气槽\n出身于同一所赛马娘养成学校，是位头脑派赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e53e365f0d9b0c872fcf2d339536b6aa6dc0386abf2893ed613501081b5d5d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
