    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75fd9219b1e8e02850569fa6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "巷子里有一栋老旧的杂居楼，四楼的一间房正冒出滚滚浓烟。\n几名看起来像是住户的人，正忧心忡忡地抬头望着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fb074418ed68acde18e34627ace8810b7d21548c64e08ae26ece740bc40437b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
